Hit 'n' now unless you want to see a spoiler...


	The easiest way to kill a ghost is to threaten it while talking to
it.  If you are at least fifth level and can do more than 32 points of
damage, it will surrender to you and you can kill it ( very bad for the
alignment ), rob it ( haven't tried it yet.  Might get something ), or let
it flee ( fairly good for your alignment ).  Easiest way to get this much
damage is by using the great-axe from the Goblins.  Remember to *never*
sell this item to the Pawn Shop.  brothers still should fix the bug about
being able to find the Goblin King again and again because the axe is worth
1250 identified.  That should be enough spoilers for now...

